# The parity harness's dependencies (crates/nodus-ui/parity/harness: npm ci).
node_modules
dist
.DS_Store
*.log
/target
# Secrets and local machine files never belong in the repo.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
# ...but the server release signing key's public half is meant to be committed.
!packaging/server/signing-key.pub.pem
*.p12
*.p8
*.key
*.mobileprovision
*.provisionprofile
# Golden screenshots of 0.9.4, the Rust shots beside them and their diffs stay
# local; crates/nodus-ui/parity/harness/README.md says how to regenerate them.
crates/nodus-ui/parity/harness/golden/
crates/nodus-ui/parity/harness/rust-diffs/
# Except a LevelDB log Electron 44 wrote with made-up values, which a test reads.
!crates/nodus-core/src/local_storage/testdata/*.log
